        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13747-13762"><rb>烈</rb><rt>はげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13762-13768">しい</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13768-13792"><rb>西風</rb><rt>にしかぜ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13792-13795">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13795-13807"><rb>目</rb><rt>め</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13807-13810">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13810-13822"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13822-13828">えぬ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13828-13843"><rb>大</rb><rt>おほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13843-13849">きな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13849-13870"><rb>塊</rb><rt>かたまり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13870-13885">をごうつと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13885-13897"><rb>打</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13897-13912">ちつけては</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13912-13927"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13927-13939">ごうつと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13939-13951"><rb>打</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13951-13963">ちつけて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13963-13978"><rb>皆</rb><rt>みな</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-13978-13993"><rb>痩</rb><rt>やせ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-13993-14002">こけた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-14002-14035"><rb>落葉木</rb><rt>らくえふぼく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-14035-14038">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-14038-14056"><rb>林</rb><rt>はやし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-14056-14062">を一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-14062-14080"><rb>日</rb><rt>にち</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-14080-14095"><rb>苛</rb><rt>いぢ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-14095-14098">め<