        <p>「おつかあ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51430-51445"><rb>寒</rb><rt>さむ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-51445-51466">かなかつたか、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51466-51478"><rb>俺</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-51478-51481">ら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51481-51493"><rb>知</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-51493-51505">らねえで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51505-51517"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby>た」いひながら<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51538-51559"><rb>大戸</rb><rt>おほど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-51559-51568">をがら</seg><choice source="#source-51568-51574"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-51574-51577">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51577-51589"><rb>閉</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-51589-51598">めた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51598-51613"><rb>闇</rb><rt>くら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-51613-51625">くなつた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51625-51640"><rb>家</rb><rt>いへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-51640-51643">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51643-51658"><rb>内</rb><rt>うち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-51658-51664">には</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51664-51682"><rb>竈</rb><rt>かまど</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-51682-51685">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51685-51697"><rb>火</rb><rt>ひ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-51697-51706">のみが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51706-51724"><rb>勢</rb><rt>いきほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-51724-51733">ひよく</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-51733-51748"><rb>赤</rb><rt>あか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-51748-51777">く立つた。おつぎは</seg></p>
