        <p>「お<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76216-76231"><rb>品</rb><rt>しな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76231-76246">おまんまは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76246-76258"><rb>喰</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby>べてか」<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76270-76291"><rb>勘次</rb><rt>かんじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76291-76300">はつけ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76300-76312"><rb>足</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76312-76323">した。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-76323-76326">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76326-76347"><rb>先刻</rb><rt>さつき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76347-76359">おつうに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76359-76374"><rb>米</rb><rt>こめ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76374-76380">のお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76380-76395"><rb>粥</rb><rt>けえ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76395-76407"><rb>炊</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76407-76413">いて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76413-76428"><rb>貰</rb><rt>もら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76428-76455">つてそれでもやつと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76455-76467"><rb>掻</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76467-76470">つ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76470-76482"><rb>込</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby>んだところだよ」</p>
        <p>「それぢやどうした、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76538-76562"><rb>途中</rb><rt>とちゆう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76562-76565">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76565-76583"><rb>見付</rb><rt>みつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76583-76589">けて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76589-76601"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76601-76619">たんだから一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76619-76637"><rb>疋</rb><rt>ぴき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76637-76646">やつて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76646-76658"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby>ねえか」<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76670-76691"><rb>勘次</rb><rt>かんじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76691-76694">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76694-76706"><rb>手</rb><rt>て</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76706-76721">ランプをお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76721-76736"><rb>品</rb><rt>しな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76736-76739">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76739-76766"><rb>枕元</rb><rt>まくらもと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76766-76769">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76769-76781"><rb>持</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76781-76787">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76787-76799"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76799-76802">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76802-76820"><rb>鰯</rb><rt>いわし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76820-76823">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76823-76841"><rb>包</rb><rt>つゝみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76841-76844">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76844-76856"><rb>解</rb><rt>と</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76856-76865">いた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-76865-76883"><rb>鰯</rb><rt>いわし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-76883-76886">は</seg