        <p><seg source="#source-94769-94772">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94772-94784"><rb>俺</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94784-94793">らそれ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94793-94814"><rb>仕入</rb><rt>しいれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94814-94826">たつきり</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94826-94841"><rb>起</rb><rt>おき</rt></ruby>られねえんだよ」お<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94868-94883"><rb>品</rb><rt>しな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94883-94886">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94886-94904"><rb>枕</rb><rt>まくら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94904-94907">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94907-94919"><rb>手</rb><rt>て</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94919-94922">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94922-94937"><rb>動</rb><rt>うご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94937-94958">かしていつた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94958-94979"><rb>勘次</rb><rt>かんじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-94979-94982">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94982-94997"><rb>又</rb><rt>また</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-94997-95012"><rb>葢</rb><rt>ふた</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-95012-95026">をした。</seg></p>
