        <p><seg source="#source-112983-112986">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-112986-112998"><rb>此</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-112998-113001">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113001-113016"><rb>錢</rb><rt>ぜに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113016-113019">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113019-113034"><rb>外</rb><rt>ほか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113034-113037">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113037-113052"><rb>物</rb><rt>もの</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113052-113064"><rb>買</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113064-113070">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113070-113082"><rb>喰</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113082-113088">つた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113088-113103"><rb>方</rb><rt>はう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113103-113118">がえゝから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113118-113130"><rb>此</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113130-113133">れ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113133-113148"><rb>丈</rb><rt>だけ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113148-113151">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113151-113163"><rb>遣</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113163-113184">るとすべえよ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113184-113208"><rb>折角</rb><rt>せつかく</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113208-113235"><rb>勘定</rb><rt>かんぢやう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113235-113265">もしたもんだからよ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113265-113277"><rb>俺</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113277-113280">ら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113280-113301"><rb>大層</rb><rt>たえそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-113301-113328">よくなつたんだから</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-113328-113358"><rb>大丈夫</rb><rt>