        <p><seg source="#source-134750-134753">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-134753-134774"><rb>明日</rb><rt>あした</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-134774-134777">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-134777-134798"><rb>屹度</rb><rt>きつと</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-134798-134810"><rb>來</rb><rt>く</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-134810-134831">るやうにいつて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-134831-134843"><rb>遣</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby>つたよ」<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-134855-134876"><rb>勘次</rb><rt>かんじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-134876-134882">はお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-134882-134897"><rb>品</rb><rt>しな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-134897-134900">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-134900-134915"><rb>耳</rb><rt>みゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-134915-134918">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-134918-134933"><rb>口</rb><rt>くち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-134933-134936">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-134936-134951"><rb>當</rb><rt>あて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-134951-134966">ていつた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-134966-134990"><rb>今更</rb><rt>いまさら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-134990-135002">のやうに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-135002-135026"><rb>近所</rb><rt>きんじよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-135026-135029">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-135029-135044"><rb>者</rb><rt>もの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-135044-135047">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-135047-135062"><rb>頼</rb><rt>たの</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-135062-135071">まれて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-135071-135092"><rb>夜通</rb><rt>よどほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-135092-135101">しにも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-135101-135113"><rb>行</rb><rt>