        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237297-237318"><rb>勘次</rb><rt>かんじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237318-237333">はどうにか</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237333-237348"><rb>稼</rb><rt>かせ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237348-237351">ぎ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237351-237363"><rb>出</rb><rt>だ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237363-237369">して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237369-237384"><rb>歸</rb><rt>かへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237384-237396">りたいと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237396-237411"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237411-237420">つて一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237420-237459"><rb>生懸命</rb><rt>しやうけんめい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237459-237483">になつたがそれは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237483-237501"><rb>僅</rb><rt>わづか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237501-237504">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237504-237528"><rb>生命</rb><rt>せいめい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237528-237531">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237531-237546"><rb>繋</rb><rt>つな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237546-237549">ぎ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237549-237561"><rb>得</rb><rt>え</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237561-237567">たに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237567-237582"><rb>過</rb><rt>すぎ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237582-237606">ないのであつた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237606-237630"><rb>近所</rb><rt>きんじよ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237630-237633">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237633-237651"><rb>村落</rb><rt>むら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-237651-237657">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-237657-237669"><rb>行</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-