        <p>「そんなに<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258340-258364"><rb>可怖</rb><rt>おつかな</rt></ruby>びつくりやんぢやねえかうすんだ」<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258412-258433"><rb>勘次</rb><rt>かんじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258433-258436">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258436-258457"><rb>遲緩</rb><rt>もどか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258457-258460">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258460-258475"><rb>相</rb><rt>さう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258475-258490">におつぎの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258490-258514"><rb>萬能</rb><rt>まんのう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258514-258526">をとつて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258526-258538"><rb>打</rb><rt>う</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258538-258541">ち</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258541-258553"><rb>込</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258553-258559">んで</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-258559-258571"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-258571-258582">せる。</seg></p>
