        <p><seg source="#source-457696-457699">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-457699-457717"><rb>尤</rb><rt>もつと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-457717-457750">もさねそりや、それだが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-457750-457765"><rb>腹</rb><rt>はら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-457765-457768">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-457768-457780"><rb>立</rb><rt>た</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-457780-457783">つ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-457783-457804"><rb>時分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-457804-457807">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-457807-457822"><rb>憎</rb><rt>にく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-457822-457825">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-457825-457840"><rb>奴</rb><rt>やつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-457840-457846">だと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-457846-457861"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-457861-457870">つても</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-457870-457897"><rb>後悔</rb><rt>こうくわい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-457897-457903">する</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-457903-457918"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-457918-457921">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-457921-457933"><rb>無</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-457933-457942">いとも</seg><seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-457945-457987"><seg source="#source-457942-457945">い</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-457966-457972">ママ</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-457987-458005">ひないしね、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-458005-458020"><rb>少</rb><rt>すこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-458020-458038">しのことで二</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-458038-458056"><rb>代</rb><rt>だい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-458056-458062">も三</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source