        <p>「はあいさうでござりますよ、お<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-459448-459466"><rb>内儀</rb><rt>かみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-459466-459475">さんの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-459475-459499"><rb>厄介</rb><rt>やつけえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-459499-459502">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-459502-459514"><rb>成</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-459514-459550">りあんしたつけが、あれも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-459550-459565"><rb>今</rb><rt>いま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-459565-459571">ぢや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-459571-459595"><rb>大層</rb><rt>たえそう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-459595-459601">えゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-459601-459625"><rb>鹽梅</rb><rt>あんべい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-459625-459646">でがしてない、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-459646-459676"><rb>四人目</rb><rt>よつたりめ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-459676-459691"><rb>漸</rb><rt>やつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-459691-459706">とそんでも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-459706-459724"><rb>男</rb><rt>をとこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-459724-459742">でがすよ、お</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-459742-459760"><rb>内儀</rb><rt>かみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-459760-459769">さんに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-459769-459781"><rb>云</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-459781-459790">あれた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-459790-459805"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-459805-459817">にやわし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-459817-459829"><rb>等</rb><rt>ら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-459829-459838">もはあ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-459838-459853"><rb>澁</rb><rt>しび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-459853-459862">れえて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#