        <p>「それでも<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-460974-460989"><rb>孫</rb><rt>まご</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-460989-461001"><rb>抱</rb><rt>だ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-461001-461010">きには</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461010-461022"><rb>行</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby>つたかね」</p>
        <p>「ほんに、わしや<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461063-461081"><rb>今日</rb><rt>けふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-461081-461087">らお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461087-461105"><rb>内儀</rb><rt>かみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-461105-461111">さん</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461111-461126"><rb>處</rb><rt>とこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-461126-461129">さ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461129-461141"><rb>行</rb><rt>え</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-461141-461150">くべと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461150-461165"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-461165-461171">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461171-461183"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-461183-461192">たら、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461192-461207"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-461207-461222">ちこつたか</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461222-461234"><rb>恁</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-461234-461240">んな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461240-461255"><rb>騷</rb><rt>さわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-461255-461267">ぎではあ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461267-461279"><rb>行</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-461279-461285">くも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461285-461303"><rb>出來</rb><rt>でき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-461303-461324">ねえで、わしや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461324-461345"><rb>昨日</rb><rt>きのふ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461345-461360"><rb>歸</rb><rt>けえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-461360-461366">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461366-461378"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-461378-461381">た</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-461381-461399"><rb>處</rb><rt>ところ