t>ひそか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466064-466067">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466067-466088"><rb>土藏</rb><rt>どざう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466088-466094">の二</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466094-466112"><rb>階</rb><rt>かい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466112-466115">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466115-466130"><rb>昇</rb><rt>のぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466130-466141">つた。</seg></p>
        <p>「おとつゝあ」おつぎは<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466174-466189"><rb>聲</rb><rt>こゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466189-466192">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466192-466207"><rb>殺</rb><rt>ころ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466207-466219">しながら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466219-466237"><rb>力</rb><rt>ちから</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466237-466240">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466240-466252"><rb>入</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466252-466270">れていつた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466270-466291"><rb>勘次</rb><rt>かんじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466291-466294">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466294-466315"><rb>返辭</rb><rt>へんじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466315-466339">がない。おつぎは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466339-466354"><rb>更</rb><rt>さら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466354-466357">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466357-466381"><rb>幾度</rb><rt>いくたび</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466381-466384">か</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466384-466396"><rb>喚</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466396-466417">んでそれからお</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466417-466435"><rb>内儀</rb><rt>かみ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466435-466444">さんが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466444-466456"><rb>喚</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466456-466462">んだ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466462-466477"><rb>時</rb><rt>とき</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466477-466492"><rb>汚</rb><rt>よご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466492-466498">れた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466498-466519"><rb>身體</rb><rt>からだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-466519-466522">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-466522-466537"><rb>