        <p>「さうだつけかね」</p>
        <p>「わしや、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497419-497548"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-U-59CA-153-11" source="#source-497419-497536">姊</g></rb><rt>あね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-497548-497554">にや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497554-497578"><rb>到頭</rb><rt>たうとう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497578-497599"><rb>小作</rb><rt>こさく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-497599-497602">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497602-497614"><rb>持</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-497614-497629">つてくべと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497629-497644"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-497644-497659">つてたの一</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497659-497677"><rb>俵</rb><rt>ぺう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-497677-497689">ぺてんに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497689-497701"><rb>掛</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-497701-497740">けられたことあんですから、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497740-497761"><rb>自分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-497761-497767">のが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497767-497788"><rb>始末</rb><rt>しまつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-497788-497797">すれば</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497797-497812"><rb>直</rb><rt>すぐ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497812-497827"><rb>返</rb><rt>けえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-497827-497842">すからつて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497842-497854"><rb>持</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-497854-497860">つて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497860-497872"><rb>行</rb><rt>い</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-497872-497887">つてそれつ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-497887-497899"><rb>切</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-497899-497923">りなんでさ、わし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" sourc