        <p>「どうしてよ」一<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-590141-590159"><rb>同</rb><rt>どう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-590159-590162">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-590162-590177"><rb>耳</rb><rt>みゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-590177-590180">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-590180-590198"><rb>峙</rb><rt>そばだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-590198-590209">てた。</seg></p>
