        <p><seg source="#source-635985-635988">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-635988-636000"><rb>持</rb><rt>も</rt></ruby>つてたら、やつちめえ」</p>
        <p><seg source="#source-636035-636038">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-636038-636050"><rb>厭</rb><rt>や</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-636050-636080">だよう、おとつゝあに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-636080-636092"><rb>打</rb><rt>ぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-636092-636095">ん</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-636095-636110"><rb>擲</rb><rt>なぐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-636110-636143">られつから、おとつゝあ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-636143-636167"><rb>勘辨</rb><rt>かんべん</rt></ruby>してくろよう」と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-636191-636215"><rb>歔欷</rb><rt>すゝりな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-636215-636227">くやうな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-636227-636251"><rb>假聲</rb><rt>こわいろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-636251-636254">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-636254-636269"><rb>更</rb><rt>さら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-636269-636272">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-636272-636287"><rb>聞</rb><rt>きこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-636287-636296">えた。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-636296-636320"><rb>惘然</rb><rt>ばうぜん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-636320-636329">として</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-636329-636341"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-636341-636344">て</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-636344-636356"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-636356-636359">た</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-636359-636374"><rb>凡</rb><rt>すべ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-636374-636400">てがどよめいた。</seg></p>
