        <p><seg source="#source-661228-661231">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661231-661246"><rb>憎</rb><rt>にく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661246-661270">らしいことまあ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661270-661294"><rb>惡戯</rb><rt>いたづら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661294-661303">ばかし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661303-661315"><rb>仕</rb><rt>し</rt></ruby>て」おつぎは<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661333-661354"><rb>嫣然</rb><rt>にこり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661354-661363">として</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661363-661381"><rb>後</rb><rt>うしろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661381-661384">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661384-661396"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661396-661404">た。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-661404-661407">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661407-661425"><rb>後</rb><rt>うしろ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661425-661437"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby>せえすりやそんでえゝんだ」と<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661479-661497"><rb>風呂</rb><rt>ふろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661497-661500">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661500-661515"><rb>側</rb><rt>そば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661515-661518">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661518-661530"><rb>居</rb><rt>ゐ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661530-661533">た</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661533-661554"><rb>一人</rb><rt>ひとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661554-661571">がいつた。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-661571-661574">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661574-661586"><rb>俺</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661586-661589">ら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661589-661601"><rb>其</rb><rt>そ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661601-661604">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661604-661631"><rb>雀班</rb><rt>そばつかす</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661631-661643"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661643-661658">せえすりや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661658-661670"><rb>氣</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661670-661673">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661673-661685"><rb>濟</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby>んでんだよ」<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661703-661718"><rb>兼</rb><rt>かね</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661718-661742"><rb>博勞</rb><rt>ばくらう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661742-661745">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661745-661760"><rb>後</rb><rt>あと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661760-661763">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-661763-661775"><rb>跟</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-661775-661795">いていつた。</seg></p>
