        <p><seg source="#source-740752-740755">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-740755-740767"><rb>俺</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby>れやんべ、そんぢや」<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-740797-740812"><rb>若</rb><rt>わか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-740812-740815">い</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-740815-740830"><rb>衆</rb><rt>しゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-740830-740833">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-740833-740854"><rb>一人</rb><rt>ひとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-740854-740857">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-740857-740872"><rb>婆</rb><rt>ばあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-740872-740881">さんの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-740881-740896"><rb>前</rb><rt>まへ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-740896-740899">へ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-740899-740911"><rb>出</rb><rt>で</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-740911-740916">て</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-740916-740919">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-740919-740931"><rb>俺</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-740931-740934">ら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-740934-740958"><rb>生口</rb><rt>いきぐち</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-740958-740970"><rb>寄</rb><rt>よ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-740970-740976">せて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-740976-740988"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-740988-741006">てえんだが、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741006-741021"><rb>幾</rb><rt>いく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-741021-741033">らだんべ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741033-741057"><rb>一口</rb><rt>ひとくち</rt></ruby>は」</p>
