        <p><seg source="#source-741196-741199">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741199-741211"><rb>此</rb><rt>こ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-741211-741214">ら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741214-741229"><rb>只</rb><rt>たゞ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741229-741244"><rb>默</rb><rt>だま</rt></ruby>つてゝえゝんだつけかな」といふと</p>
