        <p>「かんぜん<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741434-741449"><rb>撚</rb><rt>より</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741449-741464"><rb>拵</rb><rt>こせ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-741464-741470">えて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741470-741485"><rb>水</rb><rt>みづ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741485-741497"><rb>掻</rb><rt>か</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-741497-741500">ん</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741500-741515"><rb>廻</rb><rt>まあ</rt></ruby>せば、えゝんだよ」<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741542-741557"><rb>側</rb><rt>そば</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-741557-741563">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741563-741587"><rb>巫女</rb><rt>くちよせ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-741587-741590">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741590-741605"><rb>婆</rb><rt>ばあ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-741605-741626">さんのいふのも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741626-741638"><rb>待</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-741638-741647">たずに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741647-741662"><rb>口</rb><rt>くち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-741662-741665">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-741665-741677"><rb>出</rb><rt>だ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-741677-741688">した。</seg></p>
