        <p><seg source="#source-754489-754492">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754492-754522"><rb>大豆打</rb><rt>でえづぶち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754522-754531">にかつ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754531-754546"><rb>轉</rb><rt>ころ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754546-754555">がつた</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754555-754567"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754567-754576">てえに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754576-754600"><rb>面中</rb><rt>つらぢう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754600-754615"><rb>穴</rb><rt>めど</rt></ruby>だらけにしてなあ」<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754642-754666"><rb>剽輕</rb><rt>へうきん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754666-754669">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754669-754690"><rb>相手</rb><rt>あひて</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754690-754693">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754693-754714"><rb>益</rb><rt><seg source="#source-754699-754705">ます</seg><choice source="#source-754705-754711"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice></rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754714-754738"><rb>惡口</rb><rt>あくこう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754738-754741">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754741-754759"><rb>逞</rb><rt>たくま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754759-754774">しくした。</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754774-754798"><rb>群衆</rb><rt>ぐんしふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754798-754801">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754801-754825"><rb>一聲</rb><rt>ひとこゑ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754825-754828">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754828-754843"><rb>畢</rb><rt>をは</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754843-754846">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754846-754861"><rb>毎</rb><rt>ごと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754861-754864">に</seg