        <p><seg source="#source-754902-754905">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754905-754929"><rb>篦棒</rb><rt>べらぼう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754929-754941">、さうだ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754941-754956"><rb>軟</rb><rt>やつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754956-754962">けえ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754962-754977"><rb>面</rb><rt>つら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-754977-754980">で</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754980-754995"><rb>風</rb><rt>かぜ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-754995-755007"><rb>吹</rb><rt>ふ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-755007-755010">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-755010-755025"><rb>處</rb><rt>とこ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-755025-755040"><rb>歩</rb><rt>ある</rt></ruby>けるもんぢやねえ」<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-755067-755082"><rb>爺</rb><rt>ぢい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-755082-755100">さんはむきに</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-755100-755112"><rb>成</rb><rt>な</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-755112-755132">つていつた。</seg></p>
