        <p><seg source="#source-940612-940615">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-940615-940636"><rb>本當</rb><rt>ほんと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-940636-940639">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-940639-940651"><rb>俺</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-940651-940654">ら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-940654-940675"><rb>先刻</rb><rt>さつき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-940675-940687">からさう</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-940687-940702"><rb>思</rb><rt>おも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-940702-940717">つてんだが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-940717-940738"><rb>立派</rb><rt>りつぱ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-940738-940741">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-940741-940756"><rb>花</rb><rt>はな</rt></ruby>ぢやねえかな」おつたは<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-940789-940813"><rb>庭先</rb><rt>にはさき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-940813-940816">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-940816-940840"><rb>草花</rb><rt>くさばな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-940840-940843">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-940843-940855"><rb>復</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-940855-940858">た</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-940858-940876"><rb>噺</rb><rt>はなし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-940876-940879">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-940879-940891"><rb>繼</rb><rt>つ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-940891-940902">いだ。</seg></p>
        <p>「うむ、そんだが<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-940926-940941"><rb>碌</rb><rt>ろく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-940941-940944">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-940944-940956"><rb>有</rb><rt>あ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-940956-940971">りもしねえ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-940971-940992"><rb>肥料</rb><rt>こやし</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-940992-941001">ばかし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-941001-941016"><rb>使</rb><rt>つか</rt></ruby>あれて」</p>
