        <p><seg source="#source-941787-941790">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-941790-941814"><rb>丈夫</rb><rt>ぢやうぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-941814-941829">なこたあ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-941829-941850"><rb>魂消</rb><rt>たまげ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-941850-941853">る</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-941853-941868"><rb>程</rb><rt>ほど</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-941868-941892"><rb>丈夫</rb><rt>ぢやうぶ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-941892-941898">だが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-941898-941913"><rb>何</rb><rt>なん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-941913-941919">でも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-941919-941940"><rb>自分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-941940-941943">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-941943-941955"><rb>好</rb><rt>す</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-941955-941964">きなら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-941964-941982"><rb>働</rb><rt>はたら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-941982-941985">く</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-941985-942006"><rb>容子</rb><rt>ようす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-942006-942012">で、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-942012-942030"><rb>其處</rb><rt>そこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-942030-942045">らほうつき</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-942045-942060"><rb>歩</rb><rt>ある</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-942060-942069">いちや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-942069-942114"><rb>小遣錢位</rb><rt>こづけえぜねぐれえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-942114-942135">はとつてんだな</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-942135-942159"><rb>鹽梅</rb><rt>あんべえ</rt></ruby>しきが」</p>
