><seg source="#source-951772-951775">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-951775-951796"><rb>陸稻</rb><rt>をかぼ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-951796-951826">つちとはあ、とれねえ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-951826-951841"><rb>樣</rb><rt>やう</rt></ruby>なもんだつけがな」</p>
        <p><seg source="#source-951870-951873">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-951873-951992"><rb><seg source="#source-951873-951876">其</seg><g ref="#gaiji-4-2-94-57" source="#source-951876-951977">麽</g></rb><rt>そんな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-951992-951995">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-951995-952010"><rb>作</rb><rt>つく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-952010-952019">つちや</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-952019-952040"><rb>大層</rb><rt>たえそ</rt></ruby>なもんぢやねえかな」おつたは<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-952082-952100"><rb>驚</rb><rt>おどろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-952100-952129">いたやうにいつた。</seg></p>
