        <p><seg source="#source-970461-970464">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-970464-970598"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-U-59CA-292-2" source="#source-970464-970580">姊</g><seg source="#source-970580-970583">等</seg></rb><rt>あねら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-970598-970601">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-970601-970622"><rb>大層</rb><rt>たえそ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-970622-970631">なこと</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-970631-970643"><rb>云</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-970643-970658">つたつて、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-970658-970682"><rb>老人</rb><rt>としより</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-970682-970685">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-970685-970709"><rb>面倒</rb><rt>めんだう</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-970709-970721"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-970721-970727">たゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-970727-970739"><rb>云</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby>へめえ」<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-970751-970772"><rb>勘次</rb><rt>かんじ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-970772-970781">はぶつ</seg><choice source="#source-970781-970787"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-970787-970790">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-970790-970811"><rb>獨語</rb><rt>どくご</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-970811-970832">した。おつたの</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-970832-970847"><rb>耳</rb><rt>みゝ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-970847-970853">にも</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-970853-970868"><rb>微</rb><rt>かす</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-970868-970883">かにそれが</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-970883-970898"><rb>聞</rb><rt>きこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-970898-970919">えた。おつたは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-970919-970934"><rb>屹</rb><rt>きつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-970934-9