        <p>「そんでも<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1348280-1348292"><rb>俺</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1348292-1348310">れこたはあ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1348310-1348322"><rb>來</rb><rt>き</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1348322-1348337">なくつても</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1348337-1348352"><rb>癒</rb><rt>なほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1348352-1348373">つからえゝつて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1348373-1348391"><rb>藥</rb><rt>くすり</rt></ruby>よこしたんだぞ」<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1348415-1348436"><rb>與吉</rb><rt>よきち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1348436-1348439">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1348439-1348454"><rb>少</rb><rt>すこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1348454-1348457">し</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1348457-1348475"><rb>間</rb><rt>あひだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1348475-1348478">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1348478-1348493"><rb>隔</rb><rt>へだ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1348493-1348499">てゝ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1348499-1348511"><rb>怖</rb><rt>お</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1348511-1348514">づ</seg><choice source="#source-1348514-1348520"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-1348520-1348534">いつた。</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-1348534-1348537">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1348537-1348552"><rb>癒</rb><rt>なほ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1348552-1348570">るもんかえ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1348570-1348591"><rb>汝等</rb><rt>わツら</rt></ruby>が」<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1348597-1348618"><rb>小柄</rb><rt>こがら</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1348618-1348621">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1348621-1348636"><rb>爺</rb><rt>ぢい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1348636-1348645">さんは</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1348645-1348666"><rb>揶揄</rb><rt>からか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1348666-1348684">ふやうにして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1348684-1348702"><rb>呶鳴</rb><rt>どな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1348702-1348713">つた。</seg></p>
