        <p><seg source="#source-1352738-1352741">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1352741-1352869"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-U-59CA-396-6" source="#source-1352741-1352857">姊</g></rb><rt>ねえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1352869-1352872">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1352872-1352884"><rb>云</rb><rt>ゆ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1352884-1352896">はねえ、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1352896-1353024"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-U-59CA-396-6" source="#source-1352896-1353012">姊</g></rb><rt>ねえ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1353024-1353039"><rb>爺</rb><rt>ぢい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1353039-1353042">が</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1353042-1353057"><rb>處</rb><rt>とこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1353057-1353060">さ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1353060-1353072"><rb>行</rb><rt>え</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1353072-1353099">ぐつちとおとつゝあ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1353099-1353114"><rb>怒</rb><rt>おこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1353114-1353138">んだ、さうしたら</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1353138-1353266"><rb><g ref="#gaiji-U-59CA-396-6" source="#source-1353138-1353254">姊</g></rb><rt>ねえ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1353266-1353269">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1353269-1353284"><rb>怒</rb><rt>おこ</rt></ruby>らつたんだあ」<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1353305-1353326"><rb>與吉</rb><rt>よきち</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1353326-1353329">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1353329-1353350"><rb>自分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1353350-1353353">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1353353-1353371"><rb>心</rb><rt>こゝろ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1353371-1353374">に</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1353374-1353389"><rb>少</rb><rt>すこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source